<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MEMC Electronic cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MEMC Electronic cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan said it downgraded MEMC Electronic Materials Inc to long-term buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Cited weakened price environment, which adds uncertainty to earnings estimates and near-term view on the stock.  Said expects stock to weaken from current levels until the pricing environment stabilizes.</p>
<p>-- On Thursday, MEMC posted second quarter earnings of $0.09 a share, including a gain, compared with $1.12 a year ago.</p>
<p>-- MEMC closed Thursday at 38-8/16.</p>
</text>
